  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This audience recording captures Mountain Goats performing on Saturday, April 19, 2014, at Laurie's Planet of Sound in Chicago, Illinois [1]. The setlist consists of eight songs, running for a total of twenty-six minutes [1]. The performance was taped by The Annotated Mountain Goats, providing a documented lineage for the audio [1]. This specific show is identified as number 193 out of 467 total archived performances for the performer [2]. The previous archived show occurred on October 13, 2013, at People's Place, Paradiso, in Amsterdam [2]. \"Sign of the Crow 2\" marks a bustout, appearing for the first time in 53 archived shows after a gap of 1,849 days, with only six archived performances total [2]. \"Surrounded\" is also rare, with fourteen archived performances [2]. \"Elijah\" is a bustout, first appearing in 35 archived shows after 1,112 days [2]. \"Shower\" is both a bustout and rare, first appearing in 38 archived shows after 1,117 days, with only seven archived performances [2]. \"There Will Be No Divorce\" is a bustout, first appearing in 43 archived shows after 1,599 days [2]. The remaining songs are \"San Bernardino,\" \"Cotton,\" and \"Up the Wolves\" [1]. This is the only available recording of this specific event [1].",
